#==============================================================================================
#
#   svg/names - The element and attribute names the document tree knows
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Generated from resvg's name lists (usvg's svgtree/names.rs), sorted so a name is
#       found by binary search; each enum case's value is its place in its table. An
#       attribute also carries flags: whether it is a presentation attribute (settable by
#       CSS), whether it inherits, whether it accepts `inherit`, and the initial value that
#       `inherit` falls back to when no ancestor sets it.
#
#==============================================================================================

## An SVG element the tree keeps; any other element is dropped with its content.
